{"data":{"ExtRef_Child_hu_note":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"（戊寅、六八）","note_content_jianti_auto":"（戊寅、六八）","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"951128d0-db0e-11ef-8302-a0d3651f611f"},"ExtRef_Children_contents":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"樂，音洛；下同。","note_content_jianti_auto":"乐，音洛；下同。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":58,"tongjian_id":"951128d2-db0e-11ef-bad5-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"采菽，詩·小雅之章也。其詩曰：采菽采菽，筐之筥之；君子來朝，何錫予之。毛詩註云：菽，所以芼太牢而待君子，羊則苦，豕則薇。箋云：菽，大豆也，采其葉以爲藿。三牲，牛、羊、豕，芼以藿。正義曰：傳旣言羊則苦，豕則薇，則菽不總芼三牲；而言菽所以芼太牢者，舉牛之芼，則羊豕之苦、薇從可知矣。","note_content_jianti_auto":"采菽，诗·小雅之章也。其诗曰：采菽采菽，筐之筥之；君子来朝，何锡予之。毛诗注云：菽，所以芼太牢而待君子，羊则苦，豕则薇。笺云：菽，大豆也，采其叶以为藿。三牲，牛、羊、豕，芼以藿。正义曰：传既言羊则苦，豕则薇，则菽不总芼三牲；而言菽所以芼太牢者，举牛之芼，则羊豕之苦、薇从可知矣。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":88,"tongjian_id":"951128d3-db0e-11ef-b1c8-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"蒼","people_name_jianti_auto":"苍","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"951128dc-db0e-11ef-ab0f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"要，讀曰腰。蒼腰帶十圍。","note_content_jianti_auto":"要，读曰腰。苍腰带十围。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":125,"tongjian_id":"951128db-db0e-11ef-ab9d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"東平王","official_note":"東平王是漢代封爵，屬於諸侯王，負責管理封地東平國，在文中指劉蒼，是漢明帝的兄弟，來朝見皇帝。","official_rank":"王爵","source_snippet":"東平王蒼與諸王俱來朝","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"8471e42e-f5c6-4f05-aae4-c0ab8e718585"},{"confidence":0.85,"official_category":"文教","official_name":"東平國中傅","official_note":"東平國中傅是漢代諸侯王國中的官職，負責教導和輔佐王，在文中是皇帝賜詔的對象，用於傳達對東平王的關懷。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"賜東平國中傅曰","start_index":48,"tongjian_id":"8856c15c-f63e-4140-a3a4-307eebd075d9"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"爵位","official_name":"列侯","official_note":"列侯是漢代的爵位，屬於高級貴族，在文中皇帝賜予印信給諸王子，以示封賞和榮譽。","official_rank":"侯爵","source_snippet":"今送列侯印十九枚","start_index":126,"tongjian_id":"c67b4b1e-4664-41ac-8782-8945c3430964"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":30,"link_death_year":83,"link_td_description":"刘苍，东汉皇子、东平宪王。汉光武帝和阴丽华之子，明帝的同母弟。","link_td_id":"Q10000925","link_td_number_id":132458,"people_name":"東平王","people_name_jianti_auto":"东平王","people_xingming":"刘苍","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"951128dd-db0e-11ef-aa56-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":30,"link_death_year":83,"link_td_description":"刘苍，东汉皇子、东平宪王。汉光武帝和阴丽华之子，明帝的同母弟。","link_td_id":"Q10000925","link_td_number_id":132458,"people_name":"蒼","people_name_jianti_auto":"苍","people_xingming":"刘苍","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"951128de-db0e-11ef-a200-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":30,"link_death_year":83,"link_td_description":"刘苍，东汉皇子、东平宪王。汉光武帝和阴丽华之子，明帝的同母弟。","link_td_id":"Q10000925","link_td_number_id":132458,"people_name":"東平王","people_name_jianti_auto":"东平王","people_xingming":"刘苍","start_index":91,"tongjian_id":"951128e1-db0e-11ef-88e9-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"東平國","place_name_jianti_auto":"东平国","resolved_place_entity_id":735,"start_index":40,"tongjian_id":"951128df-db0e-11ef-bcb4-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"1春，正月，東平王蒼與諸王俱來朝，月餘，還國。帝臨送歸宮，悽然懷思，乃遣使手詔賜東平國中傅曰：「辭別之後，獨坐不樂，因就車歸，伏軾而吟，瞻望永懷，實勞我心。誦及采菽，以增歎息。日者問東平王：『處家何等最樂？』王言：『爲善最樂。』其言甚大，副是要腹矣。今送列侯印十九枚，諸王子年五歲已上能趨拜者，皆令帶之。」","content_fanyi":"春季，正月，东平王刘苍与诸封王一起入京朝见汉明帝，过了一个多月才返回封国。汉明帝亲自送行后回到宫中，凄然怀念，难以自止，于是派遣使者捧着亲手写的手诏赐给东平国中傅，诏书说：“朕与东平王辞别之后，独自坐着闷闷不乐，乘车回宫，伏在车轼上吟咏，瞻望远方长久怀念，实在使朕心中劳苦。吟诵《采菽》，更增添了叹息。前些时候朕问东平王：‘居家时做什么最快乐？’王说：‘做善事最快乐。’这句话十分宏大，正与他的腰腹相称啊。现在送去列侯印十九枚，东平王儿子中年龄在五岁以上、能够趋步行礼的，都让他们佩带起来。”","content_jianti_auto":"1春，正月，东平王苍与诸王俱来朝，月余，还国。帝临送归宫，凄然怀思，乃遣使手诏赐东平国中傅曰：「辞别之后，独坐不乐，因就车归，伏轼而吟，瞻望永怀，实劳我心。诵及采菽，以增叹息。日者问东平王：『处家何等最乐？』王言：『为善最乐。』其言甚大，副是要腹矣。今送列侯印十九枚，诸王子年五岁已上能趋拜者，皆令带之。」","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":3583,"number":1,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"951128d1-db0e-11ef-8a67-a0d3651f611f","zhang_TJZJ_id":"zttjzj_000702"}],"reign_name":"十一年","reign_name_jianti_auto":"十一年","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"951128cf-db0e-11ef-8567-a0d3651f611f","year_anno":"（戊寅、六八）","year_int":68},"message":"success","success":true}